			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "DEFAULT TO POSTGRESQL.  Pick MySQL only for legacy WordPress / pure read-speed.\nSQLite for embedded / mobile / edge.  Oracle / SQL Server only when org dictates.\nAurora (managed PG/MySQL on AWS) is a great upgrade once you outgrow a single box.",
