			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Microsecond latency. Trivially shardable by key — scale by\nadding nodes. Perfect for caches, sessions, rate limits, leaderboards,\nfeature flags — anywhere the access pattern is `get(id)`.",
