			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Microsecond latency. Trivially shardable by key — scale by\nadding nodes. Perfect for caches, sessions, rate limits, leaderboards,\nfeature flags — anywhere the access pattern is `get(id)`.",
