			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Pure RAM cache. Multi-threaded, no persistence, no data types.\nSimpler & sometimes faster than Redis for one job: ephemeral cache.\nPick only when you literally need nothing else.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Pure RAM cache. Multi-threaded, no persistence, no data types.\nSimpler & sometimes faster than Redis for one job: ephemeral cache.\nPick only when you literally need nothing else.",
