			"text": "SSD-optimized hybrid. Sub-ms at billions of ops/sec.\nPick for ad-tech, real-time bidding, fraud — workloads\nthat are too big for RAM but need RAM-like latency.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
