			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "AP-side of CAP, eventually consistent, masterless. Niche today\nbut still alive in telecom + IoT where availability beats consistency.\nLargely replaced by DynamoDB / Cassandra in greenfield.",
