			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Memory-first like Redis, but with N1QL — SQL for JSON.\nPick when team knows SQL but data is document-shaped, or when\nyou need built-in caching layer for sub-ms reads.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Memory-first like Redis, but with N1QL — SQL for JSON.\nPick when team knows SQL but data is document-shaped, or when\nyou need built-in caching layer for sub-ms reads.",
