			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Row keys with dynamic column families. Each row can have\ndifferent columns. Sparse — empty cells cost nothing.\nDistributed by row key. Strict primary-key access pattern.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Row keys with dynamic column families. Each row can have\ndifferent columns. Sparse — empty cells cost nothing.\nDistributed by row key. Strict primary-key access pattern.",
