			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Cassandra rewritten in C++ with shared-nothing per-core arch.\n10x faster on the same hardware. Drop-in replacement.\nPick when Cassandra is your bottleneck, not your model.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Cassandra rewritten in C++ with shared-nothing per-core arch.\n10x faster on the same hardware. Drop-in replacement.\nPick when Cassandra is your bottleneck, not your model.",
