			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Strongly consistent (CP), runs on HDFS / Hadoop. Pick when\nyou already have a Hadoop cluster + need batch + random access\non the same data. Heavier ops than Cassandra.",
