			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 16.34916418297261,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "IoT / messaging / time-series at huge scale → CASSANDRA (or SCYLLA for speed).\nInside a Hadoop ecosystem → HBASE.   On GCP at Google-scale → BIGTABLE.\nWide-column is overkill below ~100K writes/sec — start with Postgres.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "IoT / messaging / time-series at huge scale → CASSANDRA (or SCYLLA for speed).\nInside a Hadoop ecosystem → HBASE.   On GCP at Google-scale → BIGTABLE.\nWide-column is overkill below ~100K writes/sec — start with Postgres.",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"baseline": 10,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b1r",
			"hasTextLink": false,
