			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Data modelled as nodes (entities) and edges (relationships).\nEdges have direction, type, properties. Native graph traversal\ninstead of recursive SQL JOINs.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Data modelled as nodes (entities) and edges (relationships).\nEdges have direction, type, properties. Native graph traversal\ninstead of recursive SQL JOINs.",
