			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Optimised for (timestamp, value, tags) tuples. Append-mostly\nwrites, range scans by time, aggregation (avg / max / p99) over\nwindows. Auto-downsampling + retention policies.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
