			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Generic SQL chokes at millions of inserts/sec. TSDBs use\ncolumnar storage + time-indexed compression (10-100x smaller).\nNative window functions for metrics dashboards / alerts.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Generic SQL chokes at millions of inserts/sec. TSDBs use\ncolumnar storage + time-indexed compression (10-100x smaller).\nNative window functions for metrics dashboards / alerts.",
