			"text": "PUSH-model: clients write points. Long retention, Flux query\nlanguage, native dashboards (Chronograf). Pick for \nIoT sensors,\napp/business metrics, custom analytics — \nnot for K8s monitoring.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "PUSH-model: clients write points. Long retention, Flux query\nlanguage, native dashboards (Chronograf). Pick for \nIoT sensors,\napp/business metrics, custom analytics — \nnot for K8s monitoring.",
