			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "SQL `LIKE '%foo%'` is O(n) and ignores relevance, typos,\nstemming, synonyms. Search engines do all of that natively\nin milliseconds across billions of documents.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "SQL `LIKE '%foo%'` is O(n) and ignores relevance, typos,\nstemming, synonyms. Search engines do all of that natively\nin milliseconds across billions of documents.",
