			"fontSize": 15.52904511066853,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Logs / observability / product search at scale → ELASTICSEARCH (or OPENSEARCH on AWS).\nSmall/medium app search, OSS, low ops → MEILISEARCH or TYPESENSE.\nPay-to-not-think-about-it best UX → ALGOLIA.   Don't store your truth in search — index it.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Logs / observability / product search at scale → ELASTICSEARCH (or OPENSEARCH on AWS).\nSmall/medium app search, OSS, low ops → MEILISEARCH or TYPESENSE.\nPay-to-not-think-about-it best UX → ALGOLIA.   Don't store your truth in search — index it.",
