			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Speaks SQL (often PG or MySQL wire protocol), but data is\nsharded across many nodes with distributed transactions.\nSurvives node + datacenter failures while keeping ACID.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Speaks SQL (often PG or MySQL wire protocol), but data is\nsharded across many nodes with distributed transactions.\nSurvives node + datacenter failures while keeping ACID.",
