			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Original NewSQL. TrueTime (atomic-clock-backed) gives global\nexternal consistency. Pick for global SaaS on GCP — financial,\ninventory, anything that must be correct everywhere.",
