			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Original NewSQL. TrueTime (atomic-clock-backed) gives global\nexternal consistency. Pick for global SaaS on GCP — financial,\ninventory, anything that must be correct everywhere.",
