			"fontSize": 14.072613795154401,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "PostgreSQL not enough? → COCKROACHDB (PG wire, easiest migration).\nOn GCP, must be globally correct → SPANNER.   On AWS → AURORA DSQL.\nMySQL shop wanting OLTP+OLAP → TIDB.   Don't pay the NewSQL tax until single-node SQL truly hurts.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "PostgreSQL not enough? → COCKROACHDB (PG wire, easiest migration).\nOn GCP, must be globally correct → SPANNER.   On AWS → AURORA DSQL.\nMySQL shop wanting OLTP+OLAP → TIDB.   Don't pay the NewSQL tax until single-node SQL truly hurts.",
