			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Stores high-dimensional vectors (typically 384–1536 dims from\nLLM embeddings). Indexes for approximate nearest-neighbour\nsearch (HNSW, IVF, ScaNN). Returns 'most similar' in ms.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Stores high-dimensional vectors (typically 384–1536 dims from\nLLM embeddings). Indexes for approximate nearest-neighbour\nsearch (HNSW, IVF, ScaNN). Returns 'most similar' in ms.",
