			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "RAG, semantic search, recommendations, dedup, anomaly detection\nall reduce to 'find vectors close to this one'. Brute-force is\nO(n·d); ANN indexes make it O(log n) at 90-99% recall.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "RAG, semantic search, recommendations, dedup, anomaly detection\nall reduce to 'find vectors close to this one'. Brute-force is\nO(n·d); ANN indexes make it O(log n) at 90-99% recall.",
