			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Distributed, billion-scale, GPU acceleration. Pick when you have\n100M+ vectors and need horizontal scale-out. Heavier ops than\nQdrant but unbeatable at very large scale.",
