			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Distributed, billion-scale, GPU acceleration. Pick when you have\n100M+ vectors and need horizontal scale-out. Heavier ops than\nQdrant but unbeatable at very large scale.",
