			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "PG extension — vectors as a column type, HNSW index. Pick if you\nALREADY use Postgres and have < 10M vectors. One DB, ACID, joins\nwith your relational data. The pragmatic choice in 2026.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "PG extension — vectors as a column type, HNSW index. Pick if you\nALREADY use Postgres and have < 10M vectors. One DB, ACID, joins\nwith your relational data. The pragmatic choice in 2026.",
