			"fontSize": 15.620708620036519,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Already on Postgres + < 10M vectors → PGVECTOR (one DB, no new ops).\nProduction RAG, want managed → PINECONE.   OSS + hybrid search → WEAVIATE / QDRANT.\nBillion-scale → MILVUS.   Local dev / notebooks → CHROMA / LANCEDB.",
