			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Stores opaque binary objects (files, images, video, backups,\nML datasets). Flat namespace (bucket → key → bytes), HTTP API,\nno schema, no indexing of contents — just durable bytes.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Stores opaque binary objects (files, images, video, backups,\nML datasets). Flat namespace (bucket → key → bytes), HTTP API,\nno schema, no indexing of contents — just durable bytes.",
