			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Practically infinite capacity. 11 nines of durability. Cheap\n(~2¢/GB/month). Globally accessible via HTTP / CDN. Decouples\nstorage from compute — every modern data lake is built on this.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Practically infinite capacity. 11 nines of durability. Cheap\n(~2¢/GB/month). Globally accessible via HTTP / CDN. Decouples\nstorage from compute — every modern data lake is built on this.",
