			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 15.52140648488785,
			"fontFamily": 6,
			"text": "Default cloud → S3 (or GCS / Azure Blob if locked in).\nHigh-egress workloads (CDNs, ML datasets, downloads) → CLOUDFLARE R2 — saves real money.\nBackup / archival → BACKBLAZE B2.   On-prem / sovereign → MINIO.",
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Default cloud → S3 (or GCS / Azure Blob if locked in).\nHigh-egress workloads (CDNs, ML datasets, downloads) → CLOUDFLARE R2 — saves real money.\nBackup / archival → BACKBLAZE B2.   On-prem / sovereign → MINIO.",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"baseline": 10,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b5p",
